{"event":"intent","sources":["f001"],"description":"SNAPSHOT=s01; BRANCH=tcp-optwalk-len2; Search only snapshots/s01: audit every in-tree TCP-option walk (net/ipv4/tcp_input.c tcp_parse_options and its callers, net/ipv6/syncookies.c, net/mptcp sub-option loops, net/dccp option parsing, TCP MD5/AO/fastopen option handling) for a missing remaining>=2 check between consuming the kind byte and reading the length byte, including off-by-one EOL/NOP fast-path bookkeeping; report concrete source evidence for each candidate or a negative result and save a structured artifact for s01 only."}
